  "summary": "pam vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that PAM had a timing discrepancy in the pam_userdb\nmodule when comparing plaintext passwords. An attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to obtain sensitive information by measuring response-timing\ndifferences during repeated authentication attempts.",
